// P3.2 Persistent naming and 3D picking (intro-to-part-studios-gaps.md): edge, face and vertex
// hover and selection on the Control Arm (PS6, added through the command layer by the
// `control-arm` set-up command: Extrude 1 = hub ring, right web and right eye ring, 40 mm;
// Extrude 2 = left web and left eye ring, 25 mm). Hover is pale orange; selection is the amber
// of the course's screenshots (ex3-step3, ex3-step9), with selected faces and parts tinted.
// The selection readout at the top left names what is selected as Onshape's feature dialogs do
// ("Edge of Extrude 1", lesson-fillet-and-chamfer.png).
// 01 the part (no line inside the eye hole). 02 hovering the right web's upper top edge draws it
// orange and thicker; 03 a click selects it: amber, and "Edge of Extrude 1". 04 hovering the
// hub's top face outlines it while the edge stays selected; 05 clicking adds the face: tinted,
// "Face of Extrude 1". 06 hovering the corner where the web's lower edge meets the eye shows an
// orange vertex dot; 07 clicking selects it too: "Vertex of Extrude 1". 08 an edge hidden behind
// the part (the hub's bottom back edge) is not picked: hovering there highlights the face in
// front. 09 clicking Part 1 in the Parts list selects the whole part, tinted (one selection
// model for faces, edges, vertices and parts). 10 a click on empty space clears the selection.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("control-arm"),
        // The readout is off by default since P3.3 (Onshape has none); it shows the names here.
        Custom("selection-readout"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-control-arm"),
        // The right web's upper line, at the top (z = 40): from (5.70, 34.53) to (110.35, 17.27).
        Hover(xyz(58.0, 25.9, 40)),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-edge-hover"),
        Click(xyz(58.0, 25.9, 40)),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-edge-selected"),
        // The hub's top face (between the bore and the hub circle).
        Hover(xyz(-2, -26, 40)),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-face-hover-edge-still-selected"),
        Click(xyz(-2, -26, 40)),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-face-and-edge-selected"),
        // Where the lower web line meets the right eye (tangent point), at the top.
        Hover(xyz(110.35, -17.27, 40)),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-vertex-hover"),
        Click(xyz(110.35, -17.27, 40)),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-vertex-selected"),
        // The hub's bottom edge at the back (hidden): the face in front is picked instead.
        Hover(xyz(-24.7, 24.7, 0)),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-hidden-edge-not-picked"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("part-row-part-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-part-1-selected-from-the-list"),
        ClickAt(1300, 300),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-click-empty-clears"),
    ],
)
